All 8 tests passed. Furthermore, I'll also cross-check a few edge cases that the spec specifies but the test suite doesn't directly cover:
", "t": [["terminal", "{"command":"cd \"D:/Projects/local_ai/strata-lab/runs/work/hermes/jsondiff-1794053379\" && python - <<'EOF'\nfrom jsondiff import diff\ncases = [\n    ([1], [True]),                                # bool vs int inside list -> ~\n    ([1], [1.0]),                                 # int vs float inside list -> ~\n    (None, None),                                 # []\n    (None, 0),                                    # ~ None -> 0\n    ({\"a\": None}, {\"a\": False}),                  # ~\n    ([1, [2, {\"x\": 3}]], [1, [2, {\"x\": 4}]]),     # deep nested\n    ({\"a\": [1, 2]}, {\"a\": [1]}),                  # trailing removal\n    ({\"m\": {\"b\": 1, \"a\": 2}}, {\"m\": {\"a\": 2, \"b\": 1}}),  # key order irrelevant -> []\n    ([], {}),                                     # [] vs {} -> ~\n    ({\"a\": [{\"k\": [1]}]}, {\"a\": [{\"k\": [1]}, 2]}),# nested add\n    (1, 1),                                       # []\n    (True, 1),                                    # ~\n]\nfor a, b in cases:\n    print(repr(a), \"->\", repr(b), \"=>\", diff(a, b))\nEOF"}"]]}
